  "prefLabel": "En 1004.01 Submission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1004.01 Submission. All applicants shall be required to pay an application fee consistent with the application fees adopted by the commission and located in each utility’s retail distribution tariff. The applicant shall submit the application to the utility along with the applicable application fee, regardless of whether the facility plans to net meter.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
